    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6adf9824b09048.43792122\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">A new World of Warcraft: Forever short story called \"Unbowed\" focuses on the story of Cormack, a former Scarlet Crusader, as he struggles to accept his undead existence. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"wh-youtube exclude-units lazy-load-background\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: url(&quot;https://i.ytimg.com/vi/yT4RvUeYj5s/sddefault.jpg&quot;); max-width: 800px;\"><a aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"wh-youtube-inner\" href=\"javascript:\" style=\"padding-top: 45%;\"><i class=\"fa fa-play-circle\"></i></a></div></div><div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/news/24313105\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Cormack, a former Scarlet Crusader in life, now raised as Forsaken, struggles to accept his undead existence. After confronting both his past and the beliefs that defined him, he is left to ask himself: can a Forsaken still serve the Light?<br><br>Join Cormack for a special fireside telling of our newest short story, “Unbowed”.<br><br> <b>Written By</b> : Sean Copeland<br> <b>Illustrated By</b> : Surfside 3D<br> <b>Narrated By</b> : Jesse Burch as Cormack<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/template_resource/GU1EME7LW5WB1792604705816.pdf\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Downloadable PDF</a></b></div><hr>Read more stories and stay up to date on the latest World of Warcraft news at <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/<wbr>news</a>.</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>A new World of Warcraft: Forever short story called &quot;Unbowed&quot; focuses on the story of Cormack, a former Scarlet Crusader, as he struggles to accept his undead existence. <br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">Cormack, a former Scarlet Crusader in life, now raised as Forsaken, struggles to accept his undead existence. After confronting both his past and the beliefs that defined him, he is left to ask himself: can a Forsaken still serve the Light?<br /><br />Join Cormack for a special fireside telling of our newest short story, “Unbowed”.<br /><br /> <b>Written By</b> : Sean Copeland<br /> <b>Illustrated By</b> : Surfside 3D<br /> <b>Narrated By</b> : Jesse Burch as Cormack<br /><br /><b><a href=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/template_resource/GU1EME7LW5WB1792604705816.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Downloadable PDF</a></b><br /><br />Read more stories and stay up to date on the latest World of Warcraft news at <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/\" rel=\"nofollow\">worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news</a>.</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
