    "title": {
      "en": "New Talebound Toy Allows Companion Pets to Fly on an Enchanted Book",
      "es": "El nuevo juguete Talebound permite a las mascotas acompañantes volar en un libro encantado"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "New Talebound Toy Allows Companion Pets to Fly on an Enchanted Book...",
      "es": "El nuevo juguete Talebound permite a las mascotas acompañantes volar en un libro encantado..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6adf96d9d9e0e6.72096617\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">A new item datamined on the Patch 12.1.7 PTR allows battle pets to fly on an enchanted flying book!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/talebound-overview-rewards\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Talebound Guide</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_dungeon_waycrestmannor.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div><br><br>In the recent Patch 12.1.7 PTR build, we've datamined the <a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/item=288899/hexed-tiny-tome\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Hexed Tiny Tome\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bookmountdrust.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Hexed Tiny Tome</span></a> toy. This is listed as dropping from Talebound, the new Roguelite game mode in Patch 12.1.7.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><span data-markup-tooltip-container=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\" class=\"wowhead-tooltip-inline exclude-units wowhead-tooltip-inline-icon\"></span></div><br><br>This toy seems very similar to the existing <a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/item=147832/magical-saucer\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Magical Saucer\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/creatureportrait_nexus_floating_disc.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Magical Saucer</span></a>, which allows your companion pet to follow you around on a disc. With this toy, your companion pet will likely follow you on a flying book, similar to the <a class=\"q4 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/item=275255/shadowbound-storybook\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Shadowbound Storybook\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bookmountdrust.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Shadowbound Storybook</span></a> mount that is also obtained from the game mode. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1306472.png\" id=\"1306472\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1306472.png?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Shadowbound Storybook Mount\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.77765 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>When this toy releases in Patch 12.1.7, don't forget about the <a class=\"q4 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/item=140231/narcissas-mirror\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Narcissa's Mirror\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_7_0raid_trinket_010a.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Narcissa's Mirror</span></a> toy! This toy will allow you to change the model of your pet, so you can have a mini-me following you around on an enchanted flying book.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>A new item datamined on the Patch 12.1.7 PTR allows battle pets to fly on an enchanted flying book!<br /><br />Talebound Guide<br /><br />In the recent Patch 12.1.7 PTR build, we've datamined the <a href=\"/item=288899/hexed-tiny-tome\">Hexed Tiny Tome</a> toy. This is listed as dropping from Talebound, the new Roguelite game mode in Patch 12.1.7.<br /><br />This toy seems very similar to the existing <a href=\"/item=147832/magical-saucer\">Magical Saucer</a>, which allows your companion pet to follow you around on a disc. With this toy, your companion pet will likely follow you on a flying book, similar to the <a href=\"/item=275255/shadowbound-storybook\">Shadowbound Storybook</a> mount that is also obtained from the game mode. <br /><br />When this toy releases in Patch 12.1.7, don't forget about the <a href=\"/item=140231/narcissas-mirror\">Narcissa's Mirror</a> toy! This toy will allow you to change the model of your pet, so you can have a mini-me following you around on an enchanted flying book.</noscript>            \n        ",
